      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-8 mb-3">4. Clean User Interface</h3>
      <p class="mb-6">
        One of the biggest complaints about free streaming sites is excessive advertising and confusing layouts. <strong>Soccer100</strong> maintains a clean, straightforward interface that gets you to your match quickly without frustration.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Where Other Sites Sometimes Win</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">To be completely fair, some competing platforms do have advantages in specific situations:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Larger Link Libraries:</strong> Some older established sites have more individual stream links per match, giving more backup options if one stream fails.</li>
        <li><strong>Community Features:</strong> Certain platforms have chat features and user communities built around matches.</li>
        <li><strong>Niche League Coverage:</strong> A few specialized sites focus deeply on specific regional leagues that <strong>Soccer100</strong> may not always cover.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Real User Experience: Soccer100</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Here is what the typical <strong>Soccer100</strong> experience looks like:</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 mb-8">
