      <p class="mb-6">
        Mobile streaming has become the dominant way fans watch soccer. <strong>Soccer100</strong> was built with mobile users in mind from day one. The responsive design automatically adjusts to any screen size — whether you're on a small Android phone or a large iPad.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Competing sites often struggle with mobile optimization, displaying desktop layouts on phones or having buttons too small to tap accurately.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Final Verdict: Soccer100 Wins</h2>
